			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Diluc"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 3770201,
					"content": "You're here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770202,
					"content": "#Wait, you're... {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770203,
						3770204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770203,
					"content": "...Jean?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 3770205,
					"content": "Well, first of all, I contacted more than one person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770206,
					"content": "Secondly, she came here as \"Jean\" herself, not as the Acting Grand Master.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770207,
					"content": "A Jean you would never see, even as an Honorary Knight.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770208,
					"content": "What a surprise.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770209,
					"content": "I heard about the Holy Lyre, but I never suspected it was you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770210,
					"content": "So, the sound of the Holy Lyre can purify Stormterror and return it to normal... Is that true?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770211,
					"content": "#That's right! {NICKNAME} is putting themselves on the front line to try and resolve this Stormterror issue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770212,
					"content": "Now that's the hotshot of the Knights of Favonius I'm talking about.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770213,
					"content": "Feels like we're breaking the law though...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770214,
					"content": "I understand this kind of absurd explanation is hard to believe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770215,
					"content": "But, we can ask the bard to play the song again to try and persuade—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770216,
					"content": "I believe you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770217,
					"content": "To persuade our stubborn comman— Wait, what?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770218,
					"content": "I can't think of any reason for Dvalin's betrayal, given it was once one of The Four Winds.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770219,
					"content": "However, if it was poisoned in the battle over Mondstadt all those years ago...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770220,
					"content": "And then corrupted by the Abyss Mage after it woke up — we can't really blame it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770221,
					"content": "But as Acting Grand Master I obviously cannot make such a statement publicly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770222,
					"content": "Diplomatic pressure from the Fatui makes it hard for us to seek a peaceful resolution to the Stormterror issue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770223,
					"content": "People would think I've lost grip on the gravity of the situation. That's why I can only do this in private.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770224,
					"content": "Hmph.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770225,
					"content": "That's one of the reasons I don't like the Knights of Favonius.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770226,
					"content": "What surprises me is that you would believe an outlander so easily...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770227,
					"content": "#My cautious and meticulous <color=#00E1FFFF>superior</color>, even you trust {M#him}{F#her}. Don't you, sir?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770228,
					"content": "I already told you not to call me sir... Never mind. We don't often get to work together after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770229,
						3770230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770229,
					"content": "Sir?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770231
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 3770231,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770232,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770233,
					"content": "Wow! Um... This is really awkward...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770234,
					"content": "I have a rough idea of where the Holy Lyre der Himmel is.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770235,
					"content": "(Nice recovery! She's really talented at changing the subject...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770236,
					"content": "The conflict between Mondstadt and Snezhnaya stems from the conflict between the seven nations and their respective gods.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770237,
					"content": "The Cryo God's Fatui seem to be after the Anemo God's power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770238,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770239,
						3770240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Venti"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770239,
					"content": "So are they going to take over the defense of Mondstadt?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 3770241,
					"content": "Right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770242,
					"content": "If the Knights of Favonius publicly prevented an attempt on Dvalin's head, then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770243,
					"content": "The only other way to affect the Anemo God's power is to take the Holy Lyre.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770244,
					"content": "The number of Fatui that have come to Mondstadt is far from limited.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770245,
					"content": "I've already managed to... coerce a few reports out of them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770246,
					"content": "Diluc has determined that the Holy Lyre is not being held in the Goth Grand Hotel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770247,
					"content": "I imagine they don't want to leave something stolen in a place where it could be so easily found.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jean"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770248,
					"content": "Paimon gets it. If too much of a scene gets made then it becomes a big diplomatic issue.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770249,
					"content": "Hmph, such is the diplomacy between the seven nations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770250,
					"content": "Outlander, ready to go?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Diluc"
				},
				{
					"id": 3770240,
					"content": "So they want to kill Dvalin?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 3770230,
					"content": "(Pretend to not have heard anything)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770231
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 3770204,
					"content": "Why is the Acting Grand Master here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						3770205
					]
				}
			]
		},
